  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277260</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここは？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's this place?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277404</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はっ、そったらことも知らねーだが？
ここはお店で旅に役立つもんが
いろいろ揃ってるだーよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hah, ya don't even know that much? This
here's a shop, and they've got all sorts
of things what'll be useful on your travels.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277484</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>へん！
タンス野郎が偉そうに</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph! Acting pretty
cocky, for a closet freak.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Review: Maybe something less offensive.
maybe "This dumb dresser sure like sto run his mouth!"</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277608</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>たたたた、た、たんすぅ～～!?
ざけっでねーよ！
おらをバカにすっかもう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C-C-C-C...C-Closet!? I'll be damned
if I'll let ya talk to me like that!
Tryin' to ridicule me, are ya?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;。
アルベルトさんでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He has a name, &lt;Dio&gt;.
It's "Albert." Right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277840</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おーおーほほ、さすがは&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;だ。
おらのことをよーぐわがっでる。
優しい娘っ子だなや～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ohh, ohoho, of course &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;'d come to
my rescue. Ya really get me, doncha?
Such a kind-hearted little lady~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277912</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;って……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;"...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278052</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんな&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;のために、
ここはおらが買い物の仕方、
手取り足取り教えてやるだーよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And just fer &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;'s sake, I'll give
ya a real thorough explanation on
how to go about makin' a purchase.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278324</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>えーまんず、店の人間に
ちゃんと挨拶するだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, first off, you'll need to
greet the people what work there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278324</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おい、おめんとこ商品
買いに来てやったど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oi, we've come to buy
some goods from ya.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278588</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わ、
クローゼットが
しゃべった！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wha... Did this 
wardrobe just
talk!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278588</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いや……クローゼットでも
お客様……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, uh... He might be
a wardrobe, but he's
still a customer...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278588</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いらっしゃいませ～♪
道具屋『天地無用』へ
ようこそ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hello~ And welcome
to the item shop,
"The Rightside Up"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278588</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>お探しの品は何でしょうか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Which of our products
were you hoping to buy?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278704</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ええが？
このショップ画面に入ったら、
買いたい商品を選んで</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ya followin' so far? Once ya get
onto this shop screen, ya just need
to select the goods ya wanna buy.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Review</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278916</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>方向キーの左右で欲しい個数を
決めるだよ。んで、&lt;CIRCLE&gt;で
買ってやればいいだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Left and right on the Directional Pad
will let ya decide the amount. And then,
ya just got to press &lt;Circle&gt; to buy it all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278916</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>複数の商品が欲しい場合は
まとめて買うことも
できるっちゅー話だど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And if ya want to buy several
things at once, you can do
that, too, real smooth like.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Review</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279044</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あー、商品買う前には、
ガルドが足りてるかどうか
きーっちり確認しとくだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, and, before ya go buyin'
things, you'll need to make sure
ya have enough Gald to pay for it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Review</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279108</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_020&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>何してんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What're you doing?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279188</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_021&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>今、買ったモノを
書いてるの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm writing down the
things we just bought.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Review</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279276</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_022&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>買ったもの全部
そこに書くつもりか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you planning on
writing every single
thing we buy in there?</EnglishText>
      <Notes>TL Review</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279400</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そ。いつ、どこで、誰と、
何したか、こうして
書いとけば思いだせるでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yep. If I write down the when, where,
who, and what of everything we do,
then I'll always remember it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>TL Review</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279492</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふーん……
めんどくせーこと
してんのな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmmm... Sounds
like a pain.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279816</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_026&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>メニューのライブラリを開けば、
&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;が書いたメモが
いつでも見られるだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you open the Library from the
Menu, you can read the memos
&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt; has written whenever ya like.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279816</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_027&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>これからの旅に
色々と役立つ情報ばかりだで、
こまめに確認するといいべよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There'll be lots of info in there
what'll be useful on your journey, so
make sure to check it real often.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280044</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_020_020_030&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>さ、行こうぜ。
困った人探しの続き</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C'mon, let's get out of here.
We still need to find some
people who're struggling.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
